Package: scBenchR
Title: System-Aware Benchmarking for Seurat v5 scRNA-seq Workflows on Windows
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Bacem", "Saada",
           email = "basssoum@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to run reproducible benchmarking of Seurat v5 scRNA-seq workflows
    on Windows, including serial pipeline timing, marker detection benchmarking under
    multisession execution, RPCA-based integration diagnostics, and generation of
    paper-ready summary tables and figures.
